OL,3,GNEWSADerelict council HQ deemed
OL,4,A'unsafe' up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unsafe former council headquarters -
OL,7,Fclosed amid fears of bacteria in the
OL,8,Fwater supply and unsafe concrete - has
OL,9,Fbeen put up for sale.
OL,11,FBosses have decided to put the derelict
OL,12,FCounty Hall in Worcester - previously
OL,13,Fthe home of Worcestershire County
OL,14,FCouncil - on the market, after surveys
OL,15,Fidentified a #36m repair bill.
OL,17,FThe building shut in June 2024 after
OL,18,Funsafe reinforced autoclaved aerated
OL,19,Fconcrete (RAAC) was found in its
OL,20,Fstructure, and legionella bacteria was
OL,21,Fdiscovered in the water supply.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
